            "review_title": "Review at Chao Long Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n30\nDelicious local eatery serves fabulous Fish & Noodle Stew on a local budget.\nJan 2025 • Friends\nI had a late lunch here with my Vietnamese partner. My partner is a local of this district and has eaten here before. The customers here would 99% be local Vietnamese.\n\nWe ordered two fish and noodle stews. \nThe stew was heavenly and only 65k ($4) a bowl!\n\nMy partner is on a mission to show me that I can eat local good food cheaply. My partner says I am wasting money at expensive restaurants needlessly and wants to teach me how to eat on a local budget. This is exactly what I need if I am going to be living here long term! If all of our local food options going to be as delicious as the fish stew, then I am already a convert.\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2025",
